 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   ButtonBox["ParameterFit",
    BaseStyle->"Link",
    ButtonData->"paclet:QMRIToolsProcessingTools/ref/ParameterFit"], "[", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox[
      StyleBox["data", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["1", "TR"]], ",", 
     SubscriptBox[
      StyleBox["data", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["2", "TR"]], ",", " ", 
     StyleBox["\[Ellipsis]", "TR"]}], "}"}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"a653044f-350b-884d-9ed8-e4ee19a9ed9d"],
 "\[LineSeparator]fits a (skew)Normal probability density function to each of \
the datasets. Is used in ",
